## What to return
A JSON object carrying "body" and "commitments". Both are strings and nothing else is required.

To ground a claim, add a citation naming a block and quoting its own words, like this:
  "citations": [{"block": "c82a3c8063d2d61a", "quote": "<words copied from that block>"}]

## The shape this answer must take
`commitments` must be JSON fitting exactly this schema:
{
  "properties": {
    "input": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "kernel": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "transform": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "kernel",
    "transform",
    "input"
  ],
  "type": "object"
}